sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client / Internal App
    participant CB as Chat Bot App
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant GW as API FW GW (xN)
    participant CC as Config Cache
    participant PC as Prompt Cache
    participant M1 as Model Prompt Injection
    participant M2 as Model PII
    participant M3 as Model Jailbreak
    participant DMS as Data Masking Service
    participant LLM as External LLM(s)
    participant MB as Message Bus
    participant SP as Statistics Processor
    participant SDB as Statistics DB

    C->>CB: send prompt
    CB->>LB: forward request
    LB->>RL: route request
    RL->>GW: forward (rate OK)

    GW->>CC: get customer config
    CC-->>GW: config (cache hit)

    Note over GW,PC: Cache hit path — prompt already scanned
    GW->>PC: lookup hash(customer+prompt)
    PC-->>GW: verdict: PASS (cache hit)
    GW-->>CB: cached PASS — skip to DMS
    Note over GW: Skip models entirely

    Note over GW,PC: Cache miss path — prompt not seen before
    GW->>PC: lookup hash(customer+prompt)
    PC-->>GW: miss

    par Parallel model scanning
        GW->>M1: scan(prompt)
    and
        GW->>M2: scan(prompt)
    and
        GW->>M3: scan(prompt)
    end

    M1-->>GW: PASS
    M2-->>GW: PASS
    M3-->>GW: PASS

    GW->>PC: cache verdict PASS

    GW->>DMS: sanitize(prompt, config_rules)
    DMS->>CC: get masking rules
    CC-->>DMS: rules
    DMS-->>GW: sanitized prompt + masking metadata

    GW->>LLM: forward sanitized prompt
    LLM-->>GW: response

    GW-->>CB: response
    CB-->>C: response

    GW-)MB: emit request event (async)
    MB-)SP: consume event
    SP-)SDB: persist statistics